sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as Server
  participant I as Identity provider
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/auth/oauth/flows<br/>{"return_to": "/ui/"}
  S-->>C: 201 flow_id, poll_secret,<br/>authorize_url, expires_at
  C->>B: open authorize_url
  B->>I: authorize<br/>(state, PKCE, nonce)
  Note over B,I: the person signs in
  I-->>B: 302 to the callback<br/>with code and state
  B->>S: GET …/auth/oauth/callback<br/>?code=…&state=…
  S->>I: exchange the code<br/>(PKCE verifier)
  I-->>S: ID token
  S-->>B: 303 to return_to,<br/>flow id in the fragment
  loop every poll_interval_s
    C->>S: POST …/flows/{flow_id}<br/>{"poll_secret"}
    S-->>C: 200 {"state": "pending"}
  end
  C->>S: POST …/flows/{flow_id}<br/>{"poll_secret"}
  S-->>C: 200 {"state": "complete",<br/>"access_token", …} (once)
